msgid "Delete removes the draft tile under the cursor; Backspace undoes the last placement; Z cancels the draft; F submits. G exchanges tiles; P passes. C reads the rack; I cycles free, alphabetic and vowel-first rack order; Y previews words and points; L lists played words; E reads tile counts; S reads scores; T reads whose turn it is. Writing advances past committed letters. Sorting requires cancelling the draft. These shortcuts do not act in chat."
