#: games/generated/rulebooks/duck_racing.rb:10
msgid "Duck Racing is a game for two to eight players. Race around Peaceful Pond, use cards to help your duck or hold up your rivals, and compete for feathers in challenges. The first duck to complete the agreed number of laps wins."
